<body>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: October 3, 2026</p>

  <p>
    Bank Card Locker (“the app”) helps you organize card, bank account,
    insurance, family, and related financial information on your device.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you save</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on the features you use, information may include your name and
    profile image; card numbers, expiry dates, CVV, cardholder names and card
    preferences; bank account details, balances, IFSC codes and UPI IDs;
    insurance policy details and documents; family member details; notes; and
    reminder settings.
  </p>

  <h2>How your information is used</h2>
  <p>
    The app uses information you enter to display and organize your records,
    help you search them, show summaries, and schedule reminders on your
    device. NFC card scanning can be used to read supported card information
    when you choose to scan a card. The camera can be used to capture
    insurance documents when you choose that option.
  </p>

  <h2>Storage and security</h2>
  <p>
    Your records are stored locally in the app. The app uses an encrypted
    database and encrypted preferences, and applies additional encryption to
    certain sensitive fields. Optional biometric authentication is handled by
    Android; the app does not receive or store your biometric data.
  </p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    The app does not upload your saved records to Bank Card Locker servers.
    If you choose to share information, the app passes the information you
    selected to the app you choose through Android’s sharing features. UPI
    payments are handled by the separate UPI app you choose. Those apps have
    their own privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
  <p>
    Your information remains on your device until you delete it. “Delete All
    Data” removes saved records from the app database. To remove remaining
    app data and files, clear the app’s storage in Android settings or
    uninstall the app.
  </p>

  <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Bank Card Locker is a general-purpose financial organizer and is not
    designed for children.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated when the app’s features or data practices
    change. The latest version will be available at this page.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions, contact
    <a href="mailto:pravin.ambition@gmail.com">
      support.cardmanager@gmail.com
    </a>.
  </p>
